                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<p>This marks the fourth year that Roadlab has operated as a level 1 BBBEE contributor.</p>\n<p>Roadlab is assessed using the BBBEE scorecard for construction companies, which sets a higher standard than the generic level 1 assessment.</p>\n<p>We look forward to seeing the rest of the industry meet this higher standard for South Africa's construction sector.</p>\n<p>Got questions? Leave us an query below.</p>",
